  You generally can't untrap a pet from a pit in Sokoban because there's
no place for it to go with you standing next to it.

  If the cat keeps going back into the pit there may be a reason for it.
A tripe ration in a farther pit will attract the cat back into the pit
over and over again until it dies.


  If the cat is in the pit you can push a boulder on top of it.  This
may hurt the cat some.  Stand back and the cat will eventually pull
itself out from under.

  Then displace the cat away from the boulder.  Push the boulder and it
will fall into the next pit.  You'll fall into the first pit.

  If there's a tripe ration farther along either work through the pits
to get it, or find some way to keep the cat from getting to the pit
area.



